TEMPORARY DEBUG: log pipelines that fail to build, with their VkResult.

Blender-owned file; the logging is Android only (#ifdef __ANDROID__).
Remove this patch once the Mali null-pipeline crash is understood.

vk_pipeline_pool.cc ignores the VkResult of every vkCreateGraphicsPipelines /
vkCreateComputePipelines call, so a failed creation is bound later as
VK_NULL_HANDLE and crashes inside the driver (vkCmdBindPipeline). Log the
pipeline name, the VkResult and whether graphics pipeline libraries are used.

Applies independently of 0001-0006.

diff --git a/source/blender/gpu/vulkan/vk_pipeline_pool.cc b/source/blender/gpu/vulkan/vk_pipeline_pool.cc
index 34f176f..67d0c8a 100644
--- a/source/blender/gpu/vulkan/vk_pipeline_pool.cc
